  "body": "Welcome to Lot 1/33 Casuarina Place - brand new stunning family home that is sure to impress! This spacious property boasts four bedrooms, three bathrooms, and a host of modern features that are sure to appeal to those looking for both style and functionality. The open-plan living area is perfect for entertaining, with a sleek and stylish kitchen, a comfortable lounge area, and a dining room that flows seamlessly out onto the sunny deck. The bedrooms are all generously sized, with the master featuring an ensuite and walk-in wardrobe.\r\n\r\nZoned for the top schools in East Auckland, these include Wakaaranga School, Macleans Primary School, Farm Cove Intermediate, Sancta Maria College, and Pakuranga College. Located in the highly sought-after Half Moon Bay area, this home is just a short stroll away from local shops, cafes, and eastern beaches, Half Moon Bay ferry terminal, the historical Howick Village, leisure centres, parks and much more. So, if you're looking for a stunning family home in a fantastic location, this is the perfect choice!\r\n\r\nSo if you're looking for the ultimate convenient living, don't miss your chance to secure this one as your brand new home. Contact us today to schedule a viewing and discover all that this stunning property has to offer!\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View their website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
